Subject: [PATCH] round C1.2: signed-in polish (Earning Paths, skill prompt,
 Matters link, pills, Outfit)

Fixes found on reports/2026-09-11/c1-signed-in (relay b73a97a).

- Rename the growth entry "Earning Opportunities" -> "Earning Paths" in the
  portal rail, the golden butler rail and the earning page eyebrow, so it
  fits on one line in both rails (Tao, 2026-09-11). Page title unchanged.
- Skills "Use this skill" linked to /planning?q=, but /planning only reads
  ?prompt=; the seeded prompt was dropped. Now /planning?prompt=.
- Rail "Matters" links to /planning?view=matters, which nothing read, so it
  landed on Chat. ChatComponent (butler mode only) now opens Matters for
  ?view=matters and removes the param from the URL. Reuses the existing
  viewMode state; no new hook state.
- Status pills (.goaa-pill, .pp-status) no longer wrap ("Not started").
- Outfit was declared in --goaa-font but never loaded anywhere, so every
  surface fell back to system fonts (LoginMenu to Arial). Add a self-hosted
  @font-face -> /fonts/outfit/outfit-latin-wght-normal.woff2 (variable,
  100-900, swap). The woff2 + OFL file are added on aika-core-01 in a
  separate commit; if absent, the stack falls back and nothing breaks.

Preserved: both Get Licensed entries (customer home and
/customer/get-licensed) with their apply buttons, on purpose, so already
licensed agents can apply from the home page. client-login, agent-login,
/portal-preview/** and Aika-owned files untouched.

Tests: new scripts/test-round-c1-2.cjs (6); test-portal-shell and
test-customer-growth-pages updated for the rename and ?prompt=.

